[Student "S"]
{NORTH has four \Ss, so instead of bidding them she makes a Negative Double.

SOUTH knows there is no 8-card fit in \Ss, but he does have \Hs 
stopped. He bids 1NT.

NORTH has 9 points and with four \Cs she goes back to that suit and SOUTH passes.}
